# scratch — ad-hoc verification scripts, never part of the submission.
# Anchored to the two directories that actually hold them. An unanchored
# `_*.py` matches `__init__.py` and `routes/_shared.py` too, which silently
# kept real source out of git and broke the deployment.
server.log
*.tmp
/_*.py
/backend/_*.py

# the case-study brief itself — reference material, not part of the submission
asa-case-study-candidate*.pdf
